WEBVTT

00:02:29.294 --> 00:02:31.093
the founder of Momofuku group.

00:02:31.468 --> 00:02:34.432
For years, people have stood in line
to eat at his restaurant,

00:02:34.456 --> 00:02:35.734
Momofuku Noodle Bar.

00:02:35.758 --> 00:02:38.558
And he's the star of the Netflix
show "Ugly Delicious."

00:02:39.409 --> 00:02:41.370
Dave has had a successful career.

00:02:41.394 --> 00:02:43.672
So why did he bomb my interview questions?

00:02:44.577 --> 00:02:48.246
Well, because job interviews,
as you know them, are broken.

00:02:48.615 --> 00:02:50.289
Even if you're interviewing someone

00:02:50.313 --> 00:02:52.595
to see how they'll do it
being interviewed.

00:02:52.619 --> 00:02:54.207
That's the bad news.

00:02:54.231 --> 00:02:56.614
The good news is that we can fix them.

00:02:57.626 --> 00:03:03.604
(Music)